        {
          "range": "40-63",
          "slot": 40,
          "count": 24,
          "name": "RESERVED",
          "type": "int",
          "comment": "预留 24 槽：留给以后（输入法文本 / 手柄 / 触摸 / 剪贴板…）"
        }
      ],
      "keyboard_bitmap": {
        "words_per_bitmap": 8,
        "bits_per_word": 32,
        "vk_max": 255,
        "bitmaps": {
          "down": 16,
          "pressed": 24,
          "released": 32
        },
        "lookup": "word_slot = w0 + (vk >> 5); bit = vk & 31; down = (word >> bit) & 1",
        "out_of_range": "vk 不在 0..255 → 当\"没按\"",
        "rule": "vk → 槽 HOST_LAYOUT_STATE_KEY_*_W0 + (vk >> 5)，位 (vk & 31)；取法 (word >> (vk & 31)) & 1。vk 不在 0..255 一律当\"没按\"。选\"低位在前\"，是因为这样 vk 连续时读起来也是连续的；反过来的话每个字内部要倒序，写的人和读的人都要多想一步。"
      }
    },
    "command": {
